notes.content:
Major Update of TE:AP to Version 2, Escape Together! 20% discount for one week starting at 12PM CDT
Version 1 Build available in "Properties/Beta", select "version1" from the Beta Participation dropdown

Patch Notes:
[u][b]Multiplayer:[/b][/u]
[list]
[*] Added button to Create/Join lobbies;
[*] Added lobby screen to view while waiting;
[*] Added character customization syncing;
[*] Added host option to select difficulty and start a run;
[/list]

[u][b]Singleplayer:[/b][/u]
[list]
[*] Reworked Main Menu UI;
[*] Added Settings UI page;
[*] Reworked audio options into Settings;
[*] Reworked reset save data button into Settings;
[*] Reworked jumping from physics based to animations;
[*] Added display system for double jump count;
[*] Reworked strength functionality;
[*] Reworked mid-run coin display;
[*] Reworked kicking animation;
[*] Reworked Customization system;
[*] Reworked purchasing colors, added more colors;
[/list]

[u][b]Extras:[/b][/u]
[list]
[*] Added capes to character model;
[*] Added additional functionality for colored capes in singleplayer;
[/list]

[u][b]Multiplayer:[/b][/u]
[list]
[*] Added button to Create/Join lobbies;
[*] Added lobby screen to view while waiting;
[*] Added character customization syncing;
[*] Added host option to select difficulty and start a run;
[/list]

