[*] Reworked Customization system;
[*] Reworked purchasing colors, added more colors;
[/list]

[u][b]Extras:[/b][/u]
[list]
[*] Added capes to character model;
[*] Added additional functionality for colored capes in singleplayer;
[/list]

[u][b]Fixes:[/b][/u]
[list]
[*] Applied fix to increase command UI height;
[*] Applied fix to reduce/remove kick-jump bug;
[*] Applied fix to force game into 16:9 aspect ratio;
[*] Applied fix to remove points from chatters when triggering !ra;
[*] Applied fix to remove hitching/freezing when spawning many integration objects;
[/list]

[u][b]QoL:[/b][/u]
[list]
[*] Removed control GUI from workshop screenshot;
[*] Added code to call ReloadBackgrounds on Main Menu refresh;
[/list]

[u][b]Extras:[/b][/u]
[list]
[*] Added arcade cabinet from The Game Arcade around play area;
[*] Added transparency over time to arcade cabinet, for night/day effect;
[/list]

QoL:
Adjusted Integration commands and player stats UI to display over the sky;
Added new Offline Streamer mode chatter names;
Adjusted completion event to sprint;

Fixes:
Applied fix to bad code that caused some achievements to not be gained;
Applied fix to lowercase all names used by the Twitch Integration;
Applied fix to remove completion event if in godmode;

New Features: Added "completion" system for each run, a run auto-completes after 30 minutes as a "win";

Achievements: Added new hidden achievement; Fixed "Bro That's A Mile" achievement distance, from 2580 to the correct 5280; Adjusted interval achievement notifications, format value into message instead of onto the end;

QoL: Scaled up Integration command display for better visibility;
